    <briefdescription>
<para>Computes adaptive retrieval parameters based on query complexity. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Usage: <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">AdaptiveRetrievalConfig<sp/>cfg;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">cfg.base_top_k<sp/><sp/>=<sp/>5;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">cfg.max_top_k<sp/><sp/><sp/>=<sp/>20;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="classthemis_1_1rag_1_1_adaptive_retrieval_1aabe810602e9a5871f47d51587d1da11c" kindref="member">AdaptiveRetrieval</ref><sp/>ar(cfg);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keyword">auto</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>params<sp/>=<sp/>ar.computeParams(</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;Who<sp/>invented<sp/>the<sp/>transistor<sp/>and<sp/>when?&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>params.top_k<sp/>≈<sp/>10<sp/>(MODERATE<sp/>query)</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>params.similarity_threshold<sp/>≈<sp/>0.60</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keyword">auto</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>docs<sp/>=<sp/>vector_index.search(query_vec,<sp/>params.top_k,</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>params.similarity_threshold);</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
    </detaileddescription>
